<title>BELGIUM: Brederode 1996 profit up 22 pct.</title>
<headline>Brederode 1996 profit up 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996.</p>
<p>(figures in millions of Belgian francs)</p>
<p>    Group net profit	    920	 vs  754</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	   1,360	 vs 1,150</p>
<p>    Gross dividend/share    93.3 francs vs 84 francs</p>
<p>NOTE: Belgian holding company Brederode said its bottom line benefitted from capital gains and higher dividend receipts.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
